35,2,1,talk,Minato,,I found that two clerks handle all vendor queries and repeat the same requests.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Jonathan,,I found that half the customer plants lose network coverage for whole afternoons.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,George,,"The capital line is frozen, but the software allowance still has room after cancellations.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,May,,I found that the last three rollouts died because nobody owned the daily entry.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Midori,,I found that copying records and misrouted deliveries eat hours every single week.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,Minato,,"@May, does that mean the people doing the entry are the ones who suffer?","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Jonathan,,"@George, if the software allowance is open, can we buy better coverage tools?","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,George,,"@Jonathan, yes, but only if we do not touch the frozen capital line.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,May,,"@Minato, exactly. The entry work is invisible until it stops, and then the project dies.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Midori,,"@Minato, yes. The hours lost to copying are the same hours that could fix the routing.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,Minato,,I think we need a proposal that fixes the daily entry and the routing.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Jonathan,,I think we need a proposal that checks the network before we promise a date.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,George,,"I think we need a proposal that fits inside the software allowance, not the capital line.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,May,,I think we need a proposal that names the owner of the daily entry from day one.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Midori,,I think we need a proposal that stops the copying and the misrouting at the same time.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,2,4,talk,Minato,,"I am worried that if we do not name the owner, the work will just fall on someone else.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,2,4,talk,Jonathan,,"I am worried that if we do not check the network, we will promise a date we cannot keep.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,2,4,talk,George,,"I am worried that if we do not stay inside the software allowance, the bill will arrive next year.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,2,4,talk,May,,"I am worried that if we do not name the owner, we will just repeat the last three failures.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,2,4,talk,Midori,,"I am worried that if we do not stop the copying, we will keep losing the hours that could fix the routing.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
